{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rev-6-1","title":"Revelation 6:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The opening of the seals in order, and what followed thereupon, containing a prophecy to the end of the world.</p>\n<p>when. 5:5-7 the noise. 4:5; 10:3,4; 11:19 one. 3,5,7; 4:6,7; Ac 4:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-6-2","title":"Revelation 6:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>a white.This seems to be a representation of the person and dignity of Christ, and the mild and beneficent triumphs of his Gospel over all the powers of paganism.</p>\n<p>19:11,14; Zec 1:8; 6:3-8 and he that. Ps 45:3-5; 76:7 and a. 14:14; 19:12; Zec 6:11-13; Mt 28:18 and he went. 11:15,18; 15:2; 17:14; Ps 98:1; 110:2; Isa 25:8; Ro 15:18,19 1Co 15:25,55-57; 2Co 10:3-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-6-3","title":"Revelation 6:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>1; 4:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-6-4","title":"Revelation 6:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>horse. 12:3; 17:3,6; Zec 1:8; 6:2 power. 13:10; Ex 9:16,17; Isa 37:26,27; Eze 29:18-20; Da 2:37,38; 5:19 Joh 19:11 and there. Ps 17:13; Isa 10:5,6; Eze 30:24,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-6-5","title":"Revelation 6:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>he had. 1; 4:6,7; 5:5,9 a black. Zec 6:2,6 had. Le 26:26; La 5:10; Eze 4:10,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-6-6","title":"Revelation 6:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>A measure.\"The word choenix signifieth a measure containing one wine-quart and the twelfth part of a quart.\"</p>\n<p>and see. 9:4; Ps 76:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-6-7","title":"Revelation 6:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>1,3,5; 4:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-6-8","title":"Revelation 6:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>pale. Zec 6:3 was Death. 20:13,14; Isa 25:8; Ho 13:14; Hab 2:5; 1Co 15:55; *marg: unto them. or, to him. over. 8:7-12; 9:15,18; 12:4 kill. Le 26:22-33; Jer 15:2,3; 16:4,16; 43:11; Eze 5:15-17; 14:13-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-6-9","title":"Revelation 6:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>I saw. 8:3; 9:13; 14:18; Le 4:7; Joh 16:2; *Gr: Php 2:17; 2Ti 4:6 the souls. 20:4; 2Co 5:8; Php 1:23 slain. 1:9; 2:13; 11:3-7; 12:11-17; 19:10; 2Ti 1:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-6-10","title":"Revelation 6:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>they cried. Ge 4:10; Ps 9:12; Lu 18:7,8; Heb 12:24 How. Ps 13:1; 35:17; 74:9,10; 94:3,4; Da 8:13; 12:6; Zec 1:12 holy. 3:7; 15:3,4 dost. 11:18; 16:5-7; 18:20,24; 19:2; De 32:36-43; Jud 16:28; 1Sa 24:12 Ps 58:10,11; Isa 61:2; 63:1-6; Lu 21:22; Ro 12:19; 2Th 1:6-8 avenge.This seal seems a prediction of the terrible persecution of the church under Dioclesian and Maximian, from A.D. 270 to 304, which lasted longer, and was far more bloody, than any or all by which it was preceded, whence it was called \"the �ra of the martyrs.\"</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-6-11","title":"Revelation 6:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>white. 3:4,5; 7:9,14 that they. 14:13; Isa 26:20,21; Da 12:13 until. 7:14; 13:15; 17:6; Mt 10:21; 23:34,35; Joh 16:2; Heb 11:40</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-6-12","title":"Revelation 6:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>there. 8:5; 11:13; 16:18; 1Ki 19:11-13; Isa 29:6; Am 1:1; Zec 14:5; Mt 24:7 Mt 27:54; 28:2 the sun. Isa 13:9,10; 24:23; 60:19,20; Eze 32:7,8; Joe 2:10,30,31; 3:15 Am 8:9; Hag 2:6,7,21,22; Mt 24:29; 27:45; Mr 13:24,25; 15:33 Lu 23:44,45; Ac 2:19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-6-13","title":"Revelation 6:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>the stars. 8:10-12; 9:1; Eze 32:7; Da 8:10; Lu 21:25 untimely figs. or green figs. of a. Isa 7:2; 33:9; Da 4:14; Na 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-6-14","title":"Revelation 6:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>the heaven. Ps 102:26; Isa 34:4; Heb 1:11-13; 2Pe 3:10 and every. 16:20; Isa 2:14-17; Jer 3:23; 4:23-26; 51:25; Hab 3:6,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-6-15","title":"Revelation 6:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>the kings. 18:9-11; 19:13-21; Job 34:19,20; Ps 2:10-12; 49:1,2; 76:12; 110:5,6 Isa 24:21,22 hid. Jos 10:16,17; Jud 6:2; 1Sa 13:6; Isa 2:10,19; 42:22; Mic 7:17 Heb 11:38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-6-16","title":"Revelation 6:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Fall. 10:6; Jer 8:3; Ho 10:8; Lu 23:30 the face. 4:2,5,9; 20:11 and from. 10; 19:15; Ps 2:9-12; 14:5; 21:8-12; 110:5,6; Zec 1:14,15; Mt 26:64 2Th 1:7-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-6-17","title":"Revelation 6:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>the great. 11:18; 16:14; Isa 13:6-22; Jer 30:7; Joe 2:31; Zep 1:14-18; Ro 2:5 Jude 1:6 who. Ps 76:7; 130:3,4; Joe 2:11; Mal 3:2</p>"}]}